Summary of functional changes:
  1. Remote Control relay setting forced off (DisableRemoteControl in both
     ~/.gemini/settings.json and ~/.gemini/config/config.json).
  2. language_server launched with --app_data_dir antigravity-cli and OAuth
     token paths synchronized with the agy CLI (including normalized base
     ~/.gemini candidate path resolution across both cold startup and sign-in,
     with regression tests in internal/lsproc/geminiconfig_test.go), plus
     graceful SIGTERM propagation to the child language_server on shutdown in
     cmd/agy-server/run.go.
  3. Default IDE version 2.26.0, synchronous bundle pre-warm, PASSWORD env
     fallback, ReplaceAll patch support, and five patches rewriting
     Google-hosted font/icon URLs to locally served /__agy/vendor/ assets.
  4. Docker, entrypoint.sh, and agy-persist.py providing transactional
     persistence, SQLite Online Backup snapshotting, atomic fsync+rename writes,
     rolling backups, and startup self-healing recovery on Hugging Face Storage
     Buckets (/buckets/private) and persistent volumes (/data).

